cmu-trait-fear-of-blood-name = Fear of Blood
cmu-trait-fear-of-blood-desc = The sight of blood or a body turns your stomach. Treating wounds takes you three times as long.
cmu-fear-of-blood-scared-1 = There's so much blood. Your head starts to swim.
cmu-fear-of-blood-scared-2 = Your stomach turns at the sight of it.
cmu-fear-of-blood-scared-3 = You taste bile and look away, but it doesn't help.
cmu-fear-of-blood-scared-4 = Your knees go weak. You need to get away from all this blood.
cmu-fear-of-blood-calm = You look away and your stomach starts to settle.

cmu-trait-claustrophobic-name = Claustrophobic
cmu-trait-claustrophobic-desc = Being shut in a locker or crate, or squeezed into a cramped space, makes your head spin.
cmu-claustrophobia-scared-1 = The walls feel like they're closing in. You can't breathe.
cmu-claustrophobia-scared-2 = You need to get out. You need to get out right now.
cmu-claustrophobia-scared-3 = Your heart pounds in the cramped space and your head starts to spin.
cmu-claustrophobia-calm = You've got room to breathe again.

cmu-trait-hemophilia-name = Hemophilia
cmu-trait-hemophilia-desc = Your blood doesn't clot properly. Every wound, inside and out, bleeds much faster.

cmu-trait-heart-condition-name = Heart Condition
cmu-trait-heart-condition-desc = Your heart can't take much. Sprinting too long brings on an episode that can stop your heart unless you've got cardiocaine or epinephrine in you.
cmu-heart-condition-warn = Your chest feels tight. You should slow down.
cmu-heart-condition-episode = A crushing pain grips your chest and your heart flutters wildly!
cmu-heart-condition-recovered = The pain in your chest eases off.
cmu-heart-condition-arrest = Your heart gives one last lurch and stops!

cmu-trait-hard-of-hearing-name = Hard of Hearing
cmu-trait-hard-of-hearing-desc = You only hear people clearly up close. Further away, you miss more and more of what's said.

cmu-trait-wheelchair-bound-name = Wheelchair Bound
cmu-trait-wheelchair-bound-desc = You can't walk. You start in a wheelchair, and out of it you can only drag yourself along the floor.

cmu-trait-weak-throw-name = Weak Throw
cmu-trait-weak-throw-desc = You can only throw things three quarters as far as most people.

cmu-trait-hearty-appetite-name = Hearty Appetite
cmu-trait-hearty-appetite-desc = You get hungry much faster than most people.

cmu-trait-high-thirst-name = High Thirst
cmu-trait-high-thirst-desc = You get thirsty much faster than most people.
